@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title RSAES-OAEP 公钥加密完整流程

participant "应用程序\n(main.c)" as App
participant "mbedtls API\n(rsa.c)" as API
participant "MGF1\n(掩码生成)" as MGF
participant "RSA底层\n(数学运算)" as RSA
database "密钥存储" as KeyStore

== 阶段1: 初始化与密钥加载 ==
App -> App: 定义明文\nPLAINTEXT = "Hello, RSAES-OAEP encryption!"
App -> App: 初始化随机数生成器\nmbedtls_ctr_drbg_seed()
App -> KeyStore: 加载私钥文件\nprivate_key.pem
KeyStore --> App: mbedtls_pk_context pk_priv
App -> KeyStore: 加载公钥文件\npublic_key.pem
KeyStore --> App: mbedtls_pk_context pk_pub
App -> App: 提取RSA上下文\nrsa_pub = mbedtls_pk_rsa(pk_pub)
App -> App: 设置OAEP填充\nmbedtls_rsa_set_padding(\n  MBEDTLS_RSA_PKCS_V21,\n  MBEDTLS_MD_SHA256\n)

== 阶段2: OAEP编码 ==
note over App, MGF: 调用 mbedtls_rsa_rsaes_oaep_encrypt()
App -> API: mbedtls_rsa_rsaes_oaep_encrypt(\n  rsa_pub, rng, label=NULL,\n  plaintext, ciphertext\n)

activate API
API -> API: 计算参数\nk = 256 (RSA-2048)\nhLen = 32 (SHA-256)\nmLen = 29 (明文长度)

API -> API: 构造 lHash\nlHash = SHA-256(label)\n= SHA-256("")\n= E3B0C442...

API -> API: 构造 PS (Padding String)\nPS = 0x00 × 161字节\n(全零填充)

API -> API: 构造 DB (Data Block)\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ lHash (32 bytes)     │\n│ PS (161 bytes)       │\n│ 0x01 (1 byte)        │\n│ M (29 bytes)         │\n└─────────────────────┘\n总长 = 223 bytes

API -> API: 生成随机种子 seed\nseed = RNG() [32 bytes]

API -> MGF: 生成 dbMask\ndbMask = MGF1(seed, 223)
activate MGF
MGF -> MGF: counter = 0 to 6\n(⌈223/32⌉ = 7次循环)
MGF -> MGF: T = H₀||H₁||...||H\nHᵢ = SHA-256(seed || I2OSP(i,4))
MGF --> API: dbMask [223 bytes]
deactivate MGF

API -> API: 计算 maskedDB\nmaskedDB = DB ⊕ dbMask

API -> MGF: 生成 seedMask\nseedMask = MGF1(maskedDB, 32)
activate MGF
MGF -> MGF: T' = SHA-256(maskedDB || 0x00000000)
MGF --> API: seedMask [32 bytes]
deactivate MGF

API -> API: 计算 maskedSeed\nmaskedSeed = seed ⊕ seedMask

API -> API: 构造 EM (Encoding Message)\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│ 0x00 (1 byte)        │\n│ maskedSeed (32 bytes)│\n│ maskedDB (223 bytes) │\n└─────────────────────┘\n总长 = 256 bytes
deactivate API

== 阶段3: RSA公钥运算 ==
API -> RSA: OS2IP转换\nm = OS2IP(EM)
activate RSA
RSA -> RSA: m = Σ(EM[i] × 256^(255-i))\nm ∈ [0, 2^2048)

RSA -> RSA: RSAEP运算\nc = m^e mod n\n(模幂运算)
deactivate RSA

== 阶段4: 输出密文 ==
RSA -> API: c (2048位整数)
API -> API: I2OSP转换\nC = I2OSP(c, 256)
API --> App: ciphertext [256 bytes]
deactivate API

App -> App: 打印密文HEX\nfor i in 0..255:\n  printf("%02X ", ciphertext[i])

== 阶段5: 解密验证 (可选) ==
note over App: 如需验证，执行解密
App -> API: mbedtls_rsa_rsaes_oaep_decrypt()
activate API
API -> RSA: RSADP运算\nm = c^d mod n
RSA --> API: m (整数)
API -> API: OS2IP逆转换\nEM = I2OSP(m, 256)

API -> MGF: 恢复 seed\nseed = maskedSeed ⊕ MGF1(maskedDB, hLen)
activate MGF
MGF --> API: seed [32 bytes]
deactivate MGF

API -> MGF: 恢复 DB\nDB = maskedDB ⊕ MGF1(seed, k-hLen-1)
activate MGF
MGF --> API: DB [223 bytes]
deactivate MGF

API -> API: 解析 DB\n├─ 验证 lHash'\n├─ 跳过 PS (全零)\n├─ 找到 0x01 分隔符\n└─ 提取明文 M

API --> App: decrypted = "Hello, RSAES-OAEP encryption!"
deactivate API

App -> App: 验证\nstrncmp(decrypted, PLAINTEXT) == 0 ✓

@enduml
